# The coverage snapshot is a per-build artifact: its coverage tags come from the
# citations in the implementation code, so it is only reproducible on the machine
# that ran the build and churns as the code grows. It stays a useful LOCAL
# coverage-regression check, but is not a durable, shareable baseline, so it is
# not committed.
